  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Investment evidence reconciliation</h2><p>Reconcile confirmed quantities to fair values and evaluate the remaining evidence issues.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs6-f1\">Fair value of Security A</label><input id=\"aud-m3-tbs6-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs6-f2\">Overstatement in Security A</label><input id=\"aud-m3-tbs6-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs6-f3\">Additional issue for Security B</label><select id=\"aud-m3-tbs6-f3\"><option value=\"Omitted pledge disclosure\">Omitted pledge disclosure</option><option value=\"Automatic nonexistence\">Automatic nonexistence</option><option value=\"No possible reporting issue\">No possible reporting issue</option><option value=\"A payroll completeness error\">A payroll completeness error</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs6-f4\">Response to the representation proposal</label><select id=\"aud-m3-tbs6-f4\"><option value=\"Obtain sufficient appropriate valuation evidence\">Obtain sufficient appropriate valuation evidence</option><option value=\"Accept the representation as a complete substitute\">Accept the representation as a complete substitute</option><option value=\"Ignore the model because it is complex\">Ignore the model because it is complex</option><option value=\"Use an unrelated market price\">Use an unrelated market price</option></select></div></section>",
